# AI key on a reading page, over LTE (pessimistic Plus profile), voice push-to-talk.
# 1) first ask: listening tone, microphone streams to the hub while the link is opened (pre-connect);
#    the answer comes as text and as speech (TTS), played to the end
# 2) second ask after 25 s of silence: the LTE radio has gone idle (resume penalty);
#    a page turn while the answer plays: its position save must wait for the audio
# 3) third ask with a 6 s outage right after release: the answer is lost, the error is shown
@3s      tap   68% 92%        # 阅读
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      key   next
+2s      mic   speech
+0ms     key   ai 1500ms          # hold to talk, release
+16s     snap  ai-answer          # text and speech finished
+1s      key   home               # close the sheet (HOME cover key)
+25s     key   ai 1500ms
+4s      key   next               # the page turns under the answer; the save waits for the audio
+13s     snap  ai-answer-2
+1s      key   home
+3s      key   ai 1500ms
+300ms   outage 6s
+14s     snap  ai-after-outage
+1s      end
